# Benchmark results, produced by `zig build runtime-bench` and uploaded as a
# CI artifact (.github/workflows/runtime-ci.yml).
/bench-results.json

# Compiled Run programs. `run build foo.run` writes the executable to ./foo in
# the *current* directory — src/driver.zig:409-412 derives the output name from
# the input's stem only — so building anything while sitting in the repo root
# drops an extensionless binary here. The named entries above cover the cases
# that recur; ad-hoc builds still leave strays behind until the driver learns to
# emit into a build directory or alongside its input.
